@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@sessionId = tenant-test-01
@phone = 255787885020

### 1. Health Check Test
GET http://localhost:3000/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Start WhatsApp Session (non-blocking — returns 202 immediately)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}"
}

###

### 3. Request WhatsApp Pairing Code
# Run this right after #2 — if the socket from /start isn't ready yet,
# this now waits for THAT same in-flight attempt instead of racing it.
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/pair
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "phoneNumber": "{{phone}}"
}

###

### 4. Get Session Status (Database & Memory Check)
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. List All Registered Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. Send WhatsApp Text Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessions/send-message
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "{{sessionId}}",
  "to": "255787885020",
  "text": "Habari! Hii ni jaribio la ujumbe kutoka kwenye mfumo wa Nexius MD 🚀"
}

###

### 7. Disconnect / Delete Session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Content-Type: application/json
